. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. * Model 1: Does raw athletic revenue predict student-athlete graduation
. * outcomes, before controlling for anything else?
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. di as text _n "===== Model 1: GSR on ln(revenue) ====="

===== Model 1: GSR on ln(revenue) =====

. regress gsr ln_revenue, robust

Linear regression                               Number of obs     =         30
                                                F(1, 28)          =       1.48
                                                Prob > F          =     0.2340
                                                R-squared         =     0.0574
                                                Root MSE          =     5.7289

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
             |               Robust
         gsr | Coefficient  std. err.      t    P>|t|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
  ln_revenue |   1.700207   1.397695     1.22   0.234    -1.162843    4.563256
       _cons |   84.47955   5.350836    15.79   0.000     73.51886    95.44024
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

. 
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. * Model 2: Add scholarship investment (the resource that plausibly runs
. * through to graduation, as opposed to revenue itself)
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. di as text _n "===== Model 2: GSR on ln(revenue) + aid share ====="

===== Model 2: GSR on ln(revenue) + aid share =====

. regress gsr ln_revenue aid_share_of_revenue, robust

Linear regression                               Number of obs     =         30
                                                F(2, 27)          =       3.92
                                                Prob > F          =     0.0321
                                                R-squared         =     0.2276
                                                Root MSE          =     5.2813

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
             |               Robust
         gsr | Coefficient  std. err.      t    P>|t|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
  ln_revenue |   4.229673   1.608054     2.63   0.014     .9302179    7.529128
aid_share_~e |   31.25553   12.75645     2.45   0.021     5.081454     57.4296
       _cons |   68.19355   8.643177     7.89   0.000     50.45921    85.92788
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

. 
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. * Model 3: Control for program tier (FBS is the omitted/base category) and
. * institution size, since both are plausible confounds for both revenue and
. * graduation outcomes.
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. di as text _n "===== Model 3: full model with tier + enrollment controls ====
> ="

===== Model 3: full model with tier + enrollment controls =====

. regress gsr ln_revenue aid_share_of_revenue fcs no_football enrollment_thousa
> nds, robust

Linear regression                               Number of obs     =         30
                                                F(5, 24)          =       3.62
                                                Prob > F          =     0.0140
                                                R-squared         =     0.4001
                                                Root MSE          =     4.9366

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
             |               Robust
         gsr | Coefficient  std. err.      t    P>|t|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
  ln_revenue |   4.184039   1.573346     2.66   0.014     .9368128    7.431265
aid_share_~e |   17.79215   12.70265     1.40   0.174    -8.424841    44.00914
         fcs |   .1611624   2.808022     0.06   0.955     -5.63431    5.956635
 no_football |   5.524294   2.356223     2.34   0.028       .66129     10.3873
enrollment~s |  -.0338448   .1236883    -0.27   0.787     -.289125    .2214353
       _cons |   69.98316   7.947787     8.81   0.000     53.57973    86.38658
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

. 
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. * Model 4: Same specification, Federal Graduation Rate as the outcome
. * instead of GSR, as a robustness check (FGR counts transfers against the
. * school; GSR does not - if results hold under both, that's a stronger claim)
> .
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --
. di as text _n "===== Model 4: robustness check, FGR as outcome ====="

===== Model 4: robustness check, FGR as outcome =====

. regress fgr ln_revenue aid_share_of_revenue fcs no_football enrollment_thousa
